  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Worker Rights in Rural Sectors of the Indo-Pacific with a Focus on Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve adherence with labor standards in Indonesia and the Philippines, focusing on the agricultural, fishing, and mining sectors in rural communities, and on women in the same rural sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
